<template compat="shopify">
{%- doc -%}
  A price with its currency code drawn beside it, shown or hidden by the theme's
  settings CSS (Prices & currency). Turning a currency code on or off is then a
  stylesheet change: no price is drawn again.

  When the shop's money format does not end in the code, the code is decided
  here instead, from `show`.

  @param {number} value - Price in the platform's minor units.
  @param {string} context - product, card, cart_item or cart_total.
  @param {boolean} [show] - The setting's value, for formats without a separable code.
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  assign plain = value | money
  assign coded = value | money_with_currency
  assign coded_head = coded | slice: 0, plain.size
  if coded_head == plain and coded.size > plain.size
    assign code = coded | slice: plain.size, coded.size
    echo plain
    echo '<span class="price-currency-code" data-currency-context="'
    echo context
    echo '">'
    echo code
    echo '</span>'
  elsif show
    echo coded
  else
    echo plain
  endif
-%}
</template>
